  "description": "Selected for the 2021 Busan International Film Festival IP Market.\n\nThe time for revenge has come for the perpetrators who slipped through the cracks of the law! Seung-A (22, female), a national air pistol gold medalist, has lived her life conforming to reality, moderately conscientious and moderately selfish. When her younger sister, whom she cherished more than her own life, dies in a traffic accident right before her eyes, Seung-A's world comes crashing down. Then, a headhunter from “The Hour of the Scorpion,” a secret organization that personally eliminates the scum of humanity, approaches her, and she learns that her sister’s death was no simple traffic accident. With nothing left to lose, Seung-A accepts the offer to join the organization and, through rigorous training, transforms into an action agent! She eventually tracks down Sin Yu-Rim (31/female), the head of “Faust”, a group that protects those who commit crimes using money and power as their weapons...\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
